keywords:
  - IEC 61850
  - Sampled Values
  - protection relay
  - automatic voltage regulator
  - OLTC
  - transformer differential
  - restricted earth fault
  - secondary injection
  - process bus
  - power systems
  - virtual laboratory
abstract: >-
  ARVREL is a vendor-neutral Windows virtual protection and control IED laboratory for
  IEC 61850 engineering, Sampled Values analysis, virtual feeder and transformer
  protection, AVR/OLTC simulation, synchronized two-sided transformer secondary injection,
  laboratory MMS interoperability, education, and reviewable engineering evidence.
